[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3900.225, "timestamp": "01:05:00", "text": "是的，網路正常。 我甚至做不到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3901.441, "timestamp": "01:05:01", "text": "我甚至做不到 打電話給朋友，因為"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3902.84, "timestamp": "01:05:02", "text": "打電話給朋友，因為 花了30、20或10分鐘"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3904.129, "timestamp": "01:05:04", "text": "花了30、20或10分鐘 幾分鐘後，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3905.087, "timestamp": "01:05:05", "text": "幾分鐘後，我 遠離了那段時光"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3906.302, "timestamp": "01:05:06", "text": "遠離了那段時光 地方，以及它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3907.186, "timestamp": "01:05:07", "text": "地方，以及它 成功了。我不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3914.28, "timestamp": "01:05:14", "text": "成功了。我不知道。 到底哪裡出了問題？是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3915.954, "timestamp": "01:05:15", "text": "到底哪裡出了問題？是的。 事物的本質就是事物本身。我們擁有什麼"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3918.644, "timestamp": "01:05:18", "text": "事物的本質就是事物本身。我們擁有什麼 我們有。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3926.615, "timestamp": "01:05:26", "text": "我想我已經有了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3927.771, "timestamp": "01:05:27", "text": "剩下的就只有這些了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3931.732, "timestamp": "01:05:31", "text": "幾分鐘。我有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3932.853, "timestamp": "01:05:32", "text": "剩下的就只有這些了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3933.875, "timestamp": "01:05:33", "text": "幾分鐘前"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3935.193, "timestamp": "01:05:35", "text": "順便說一句，直播結束了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3940.624, "timestamp": "01:05:40", "text": "人們。所以，嗯，是的，就是這樣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3954.957, "timestamp": "01:05:54", "text": "很糟糕。嗯，這樣好多了。"}]